WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:05.780
The MCU rumor mill has indeed been working
overtime, most recently churning out the unconfirmed

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.840
report that a new film featuring a certain
Quantum Realm explorer and his crew may be

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.520
in the works.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:16.300
We're referring, of course, to the pint-sized
Avenger Scott Lang, AKA Ant-Man.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:21.900
Now, a new rumor has surfaced one which suggests
that the flick, if it happens, might herald

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.140
the debut of the MCU's Young Avengers.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.939
"You want a juice box and some string cheese?"

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.860
“...Do you really have that?"

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:34.800
All jokes aside, most Marvel fans are already
well aware that Ant-Man's MCU status has been

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:40.000
a bit up in the air not because Lang and his
paramour-slash-partner the Wasp didn't make

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.660
it through the showdown with Thanos featured
in Avengers: Endgame, but because a new Ant-Man

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:50.650
film was conspicuously left out of Marvel's
mammoth Hall H panel at San Diego Comic-Con

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:51.560
2019.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:57.510
With Ant-Man's absence on the Phase 4 timeline,
many fans were left wondering what would become

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.080
of the quippiest of Avengers.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:04.240
To date, Marvel has yet to confirm the fate
of the Ant-Man franchise, spawning rumors

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.740
that the studio may either be planning to
take the Ant-Man and the Wasp team to the

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:14.100
small-screen via the Disney+ streaming platform,
or that it might not be planning to move forward

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:19.880
with a new Ant-Man tale at all, and that Scott
Lang's quantum realm-jumping days in the MCU

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.100
may actually be over.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:26.219
Those fears appeared to be put to rest when
self-proclaimed Marvel Studios insider Charles

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:31.780
Murphy claimed that Ant-Man 3 is now in the
works, and that the film may be slotting into

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:36.540
Phase 5 of the MCU with a July 29, 2022 release
date.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:41.520
Part of the reported scoop involves the discovery
of a new company being formed in California

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:48.600
in September 2019, with a seemingly telling
name: Pym Particles Production III LLC.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.560
Furthermore, Murphy reported that Paul Rudd
and Evangeline Lilly would be reprising their

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:58.939
roles as the insect-themed, crime-fighting
duo, with Michael Douglas and Michelle Pfeiffer

00:01:58.939 --> 00:02:02.259
presumably returning as Dr. Hank Pym and O.G.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:04.080
Wasp Janet Van Dyne.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:08.420
Now would be a good time to reiterate that
Marvel has not yet confirmed that Ant-Man

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:14.240
3 is a go for the MCU's Phase 5 or beyond
or that the film is even a possibility so

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.700
take this rumor with a big ol' grain of salt.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:22.280
Mr. Murphy has produced accurate info on occasion,
but he hasn't been right about everything

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.820
and you know what they say about broken clocks.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:30.600
Murphy went on to offer another whopper regarding
the possible narrative arc of Ant-Man 3, involving

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.140
Scott Lang's now teen-aged daughter Cassie.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:37.860
The latest bit of MCU conjecture involves
Cassie Lang following in the footsteps of

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:42.860
her incredible shrinking daddy, and donning
her own shrinking suit to fight crime an arc

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:46.690
that would then open the door for Marvel's
Young Avengers to make their first appearance

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:47.620
in the MCU.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:53.040
Needless to say, any storyline involving a
Young Avengers team would be a legit bombshell

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:58.230
for the ever-expanding MCU, and it would not
be all that surprising to see Marvel Studios

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.120
head in that direction..

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:04.560
If we're being completely honest, after a
decade-plus of Iron Man, Captain America,

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:10.290
Thor, Black Widow, and Hulk essentially leading
the charge, a little new blood would be welcome

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:15.150
and with several of those characters' storylines
either completed or very up in the air after

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:19.420
Endgame, it's clear that a few fresh faces
will be needed to take the heroic reins for

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.980
future Avengers movies.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:26.020
Other than Cassie Lang and Harley Keener,
the kid from Iron Man 3 who turned up at Tony

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:30.250
Stark's funeral in Endgame, and who has been
speculated to be on the path to becoming the

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:35.670
MCU's version of Iron Lad there are a few
other canonical team members who have been

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.640
teased, officially or otherwise.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:41.540
We know that Kate Bishop will indeed play
a key role in the upcoming Disney+ series

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:44.580
Hawkeye, with Hailee Steinfeld circling the
project.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:50.020
It's also been rumored that Wiccan could play
a part in the Scarlet Witch series WandaVision,

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:53.580
and that Hulkling might potentially be turning
up in Captain Marvel 2.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:59.180
But of course, until we get any kind of official
announcements, it's all just shiny conjecture.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:03.730
At this point, we're going to have to go ahead
and call the Ant-Man 3/Young Avengers rumor

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:08.060
highly questionable, if only for the fact
that we don't even have confirmation on Lang's

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.620
third solo outing yet.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:14.600
If we do, and if that confirmation also happens
to spawn one the biggest narrative shifts

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.040
in the MCU, then so much the better.

